# App Components

## Props

- Declare `type Props` (or `interface Props`) at the top of the file.
- Keep `Props` private by default.
- To export: `export type MyComponentProps = Props`, or use a namespace (e.g. `Dropdown.ContentProps`).

## Exports

- Named export only: `export function Button(props: Props)`.
- No `export default` for components.

## Styles

- Co-locate styles: `Component.scss` next to `Component.tsx`.

```tsx
type Props = {
  children: ReactNode;
  onClick?: () => void;
};

export function Button(props: Props) {
  return <button onClick={props.onClick}>{props.children}</button>;
}
```
